## 2. Key Technical Concepts

- **Earley Parser with Semantic Semiring**: Parser explores multiple alternatives simultaneously while building semantic values through semiring operations
- **Incremental Parse Completions**: In Earley parsing, rules can complete multiple times at different positions as parser explores the input space
- **Derivation ID Tagging**: Original system to track which parse alternative created each IR node using unique identifiers (later removed)
- **Online vs Offline SPPF Disambiguation**: 
